#. news title
msgctxt "20200214.html"
msgid "GCompris is now Free to install everywhere"
msgstr ""

#. paragraph
msgctxt "20200214.html"
msgid ""
"Hi,<br />\\nWe are pleased to announce that the full version of GCompris is "
"now available at no cost for every supported platform!"
msgstr ""
"Hola,<br />\\nallegrámonos d'anunciar que la versión completa de GComprisyá "
"ta disponible de baldre en cada plataforma sofitada"

#. paragraph
msgctxt "20200214.html"
msgid ""
"The installers for Windows and macOS on our website have been updated to not "
"require activation code anymore, and the full version on the Play store and "
"Microsoft store are now gratis."
msgstr ""
"Anováronse los instaladores pa Windows y macOS del nuesu sitiu web pa que "
"nun rican nengún códigu d'activación, y agora la versión completa de la Play "
"Store y la tienda de Microsoft son gratis."

#. paragraph
msgctxt "20200214.html"
msgid ""
"We hope that this move will make it easier for all the children in the world "
"to get access to the best educational software."
msgstr ""
"Esperamos que con esti movimientu se facilite que la reciella del mundu "
"acceda al meyor software educativu."

#. paragraph
msgctxt "20200214.html"
msgid "Thank you all, <br/>\\nTimothée & Johnny"
msgstr "Gracies a toos, <br/>\\nTimothée & Johnny"

