#: template/donate.html:15
msgid ""
"You, your children or your school love GCompris. You can support the project "
"with a donation."
msgstr ""
"Si tu, los tos fíos o'l colexu onde tas vos presta GCompris, podeís sofitar "
"el proyeutu con una donación."

#: template/donate.html:16
msgid ""
"Developing software takes a lot of time, it needs hardware, and other "
"requirements that have a cost."
msgstr ""
"Desendolcar software lleva munchu tiempu y desixe requirimientos tienen un "
"costu."

#: template/donate.html:18
msgid ""
"If you want to support the development of GCompris in a sustainable way, "
"please become a patron of GCompris on Patreon:"
msgstr ""

#: template/donate.html:20 template/downloads.html:10 template/index.html:187
msgid "Become a Patron"
msgstr "Convertise nun patrón"

#: template/donate.html:23
msgid "Also, you can donate the amount of your choice to KDE:"
msgstr "Tamién pues donar la cantidá qu'escueyas a KDE:"

#: template/donate.html:24
msgid "Donate to KDE"
msgstr "Donar a KDE"

#: template/donate.html:26
msgid "Thanks for supporting Free Software in education."
msgstr "Gracies por sofitar el software llibre na educación."

#: template/donate.html:29
msgid "Patreon"
msgstr "Patreon"

#: template/donate.html:32
msgid "Thanks to everyone supporting GCompris on Patreon!"
msgstr "¡Gracies a tol mundu que sofitó a GCompris en Patreon!"

#: template/downloads.html:16
msgid "Windows"
msgstr "Windows"

#: template/downloads.html:20
msgid ""
"You can install GCompris <a href=\"https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/store/p/"
"gcompris/9pgxjtcxn8qm\">from the Windows Store</a>."
msgstr ""
"Pues instalar GCompris <a href=\"https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/store/p/"
"gcompris/9pgxjtcxn8qm\">dende la Tienda de Windows</a>."

#: template/downloads.html:21
msgid "Note: the Windows Store requires Windows 10."
msgstr "Nota: la Tienda de Windows rique Windows 10."

#: template/downloads.html:23
msgid "Else, you can download the installer from the links below."
msgstr "Amás, pues baxar l'instalador dende los enllaces d'embaxo."

#: template/downloads.html:24
msgid "System requirements: Windows 7, 8 or 10 with OpenGL 2 support."
msgstr "Requirimientos del sistema: Windows 7, 8 o 10 con sofitu pa OpenGL 2."

#: template/downloads.html:29
msgid ""
"Note: If your system doesn't have OpenGL 2 support or if it's not working "
"properly, please use the entry GCompris (Safe Mode) in the start menu to "
"launch GCompris with the software rendering mode which doesn't use OpenGL."
msgstr ""
"Nota: Si'l sistema nun sofita OpenGL 2 o nun funciona afayadizamente, usa la "
"entrada GCompris (Safe Mode) nel menú d'aniciu pa llanzar GCompris col mou "
"de renderizáu per software que nun usa OpenGL."

#: template/downloads.html:30
msgid ""
"If you really need a version that runs on Windows XP, or if your system "
"doesn't support the new version, you can use the last installer from the old "
"GCompris 15.10."
msgstr ""
"Si precises daveres una versión que s'execute en Windows XP o si'l sistema "
"nun sofita la versión nueva, pues usar l'últimu instalador de GCompris 15.10."

#: template/downloads.html:34
msgid ""
"To enable all the activities in this old version, you can use the code "
"200202 in the entry box that contains the word CODE when you start the "
"application."
msgstr ""
"P'activar toles actividaes nesta versión vieya, pues usar el códigu 200202 "
"na caxa d'introducción que contién la pallabra CÓDIGU cuando anicies "
"l'aplicación."

